# Approved Baseline Extract

**Source repository:** `https://github.com/KingsDux/AEGIS-Adaptive-Environmental-Guard-Intelligence-System-`

**Use:** Implementation-repository guardrail. This is an index of confirmed authority and decisions; it is not a replacement for the source documents.

## System boundary

AEGIS is a decision-support system for biosecurity and health-system threat surveillance. It separates observation, inference, recommendation, authorization, execution, and verification. It is not an autonomous clinical or biosecurity authority; consequential actions require human authorization.

The approved experience is one continuous operational journey across 13 authoritative screens, backed by a shared domain model and global state model.

